# CONFIG's Basic Tuning for a plane, ported from GCSViews/ConfigurationView/ConfigArduplane.cs.
#
# SoftwareConfig adds ConfigArduplane as "Basic Tuning", and opens on it, only when the vehicle is
# an ArduPlane (SoftwareConfig.cs:173-178); a copter's Basic Tuning is ConfigSimplePids
# (:160-165). The SITL these scripts run against is a copter, so the page cannot be opened here:
# the claim this script checks is the list's condition - with every parameter in, CONFIG opens on
# the copter's Basic Tuning, and ConfigArduplane is neither listed nor shown.
#
# The page itself is proved against a scripted plane by the unit tests in
# crates/mp-gui/src/config/basic_tuning.rs: every Designer control at its .resx place, Activate's
# 44 bindings (the first name the vehicle has, the scale, the tooltips), a change held in
# `changes` and green until Write Params, Write Params through the retrying set - its "more than
# doubled" question, "Your are not connected", "Set NAME Failed" - Ctrl+S, Refresh Params and
# Refresh Screen, and the list's condition for each firmware.
#
# Needs SITL copter on tcp:127.0.0.1:5760 started from tools/sitl/params/copter.parm. Run as
#
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/config-basic-tuning.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

screen params
window 1600x1200
budget 4
# A config.xml of its own, so the "Show me again?" boxes this script clicks are not already
# suppressed by the settings of the machine running it.
env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
# RawParamWarning, on the Full Parameter List's Activate (ConfigRawParams.cs:92): "Show me
# again?" unticked, so no later visit asks, and OK.
# The vehicle first: a click before its first heartbeat is a click the screen may forget
# (vehicle.connected only says the link is open).
expect vehicle.count > 0
click raw-param-warning-again
click raw-param-warning-ok

# CONFIG lists the tuning pages once every parameter is in (SoftwareConfig.cs:148-150), and here
# parameters are downloaded when asked for.
click param-download
expect params.held > 1000

click tab-config
expect screen config
expect config.page ConfigSimplePids
expect config.title Basic Tuning
expect config.tuning.listed false
expect config.tuning.active false
